  "details": "Before this post is deleted or marked for anything negative, this is a genuine question. I was told this earlier today, and have verified this myself. \nIf I type \"chilloutVR\" into my bio and submit it it is changed to \"chillaxian\". If I type \"chillout VR\" into the bio it is changed to the previous word and all spaces removed from the rest of the bio.\nWhy does this happen? at a time when the community is in uproar? it looks like censorship. If it is censorship may I ask the dev team why this has been done? in a platform of social interaction why would such a thing (even if it is a rival company) be allowed to happen?",
